"statement to assign the outcome to a variable, as in Listing 3-2."
msgstr ""
"`if`は式なので、`let`文の右辺に持ってきて結果を変数に代入することができます。リスト3-2のようにですね。"

#: src/ch03-05-control-flow.md:191 src/ch03-05-control-flow.md:225
msgid "\"The value of number is: {number}\""
msgstr "\"The value of number is: {number}\""

#: src/ch03-05-control-flow.md:195
msgid ""
"<span class=\"caption\">Listing 3-2: Assigning the result of an `if` "
"expression to a variable</span>"
